  "h1": ["A new idea, in character."],
  "text": "Back to the workshop\nA new idea, in character.\n\nDescribe your character, choose a resolution, and generate an original cartoon portrait. The credit cost is shown before you start.\n\nCharacter builder\nAI generator\nGive your idea a character.\n\n Checking AI availability…\n\nDescribe your character\n0 / 1500\n\nA few details about their look, outfit, and personality are a good start.\n\nMountain explorer\nBook lover\nWeekend skater\nImage shape\nSquare (1:1)\nPortrait (3:4)\nGet credits\nGenerate my character\n\nAI generation uses credits from your account. Failed generations return the credits deducted for that request.\n\nYour imagination goes here.\n\nThis image was made in the AI studio. Your own generated character will appear here after your request completes.\n\nRead the character guide",
